#. project counts one site.
msgid ""
"new words to translate on this site: each page and each sentence counted "
"once."
msgstr "このサイトで翻訳する新しい単語：各ページと各文を1回ずつカウントします。"

#. the caption under a project's big number, which is a count of new words.
